"""Episode 18 (Year 1812) polygons, used by world_data_1795 and world_data_1812.
1776 -> 1795: Peace of Paris (1783): the United States reaches the Mississippi, Florida back to Spain; Russia annexes the Crimea
(1783) and the coast to the Dniester (1792); the First Fleet founds Sydney (1788); second and third partitions of Poland (1793, 1795);
France annexes the Austrian Netherlands (1795); Qajar Persia (1789-96).
1795 -> 1812: Louisiana Purchase (1803); Haiti independent (1804); end of the Holy Roman Empire (1806), Confederation of the Rhine,
Duchy of Warsaw (1807/09), Kingdom of Italy, Kingdom of Naples; French Empire with the Netherlands, the Rhineland, the North Sea coast
to Lubeck (1810), Piedmont, Tuscany, Rome (1809) and the Illyrian Provinces (1809); Russia takes Georgia (1801), Finland (1809) and
Bessarabia (May 1812); Britain takes the Cape (1806), Ceylon, Java (1811) and much of India (Mysore wars, Delhi 1803); the Sikh
Empire (1799); Vietnam unified (1802); Sokoto Caliphate (1804-09); Kingdom of Hawaii (1810)."""
